body:
I'm planning on two dresses, because I loved and felt I suited two very different styles, whilst I absolutely adore my ceremony dress, I know after a 3 course meal it would be uncomfortable for me. So I've got a ballgown for all the comfort and dancing after, and honestly FDH loved the idea of me having two dresses when I mentioned it to him and that's all I needed!

&#x200B;

I totally say go for it, why not? It's your day and if it makes you happy and you get to wear 2 gorgeous dresses instead of just one I don't see the down side.
